        {
          "text": "Uzingcolisile izindawo zakho ezingcwele ngobuningi beziphambeko zakho ngobubi bokuhweba kwakho; ngalokho ngiyakuphuma umlilo phakathi kwakho, ukudle, ngikwenze ube umlotha emhlabeni phambi kwamehlo abo bonke abakubonayo.",
