              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uthi: Itsho njalo iNkosi uJehova; Bheka, nginobuso bakho nawe, Sidoni; ngiyakudunyiswa phakathi kwakho, bazi ukuthi nginguJehova, lapho ngenze isijeziso sakhe, ngingcweliswe kulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
