              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngeke kusaba khona ikhakhasi elihlabayo noma iva elibuhlungu kuyo yonke indlu yakwa-Israyeli ababeyidelela; bazakwazi ukuthi ngiyiNkosi uJehova.",
          "type": "text",
