              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, ithi: Lapho ngibutha indlu yakwa-Israyeli ezizweni abahlakazekele phakathi kwazo, ngingcweliswe kubo emehlweni ezizwe, bahlale ezweni labo engalinika inceku yami. UJakobe unawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
